+ * its parent like any stub) and answers with its pid plus the kernel end of a
+ * socket the spare listens on. Returns only in a spare, which then continues
+ * the normal init with fd 3 = physmem and fd 4 = that socket (see
+ * stub_spare_wait() in stub.c).
