From 16fdaab6a64632e525ea6c7bc52a8526239f6876 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:17:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/18] um: also anchor a 2MB chunk when an upper-level table
 was unmapped

Lone mappings (e.g. mmap/munmap loops) free the guest pmd/pud on munmap, so
the host unmap took the upper-level path and never got an anchor.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B3kysVLGNgK27oVbqXzFEn
