From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:43:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/18] um: don't wait for a zygote spare to boot in
 start_userspace (stub_boot_async=)

Overlaps the spare's wakeup with the rest of fork. SIGALRM is held back
from a stub still booting (it has no stub data to take a signal on).
Also umstat: clone/exit/wait4 kinds, faults per window.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
